OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for multiple child
OL,4,Asexual offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for 18 years
OL,7,Fafter sexually assaulting two children
OL,8,Fon several occasions, according to
OL,9,Fpolice.
OL,11,FWilliam Lynas, 84, from Spalding, was
OL,12,Ffound guilty by a jury of 13 sexual
OL,13,Foffences including assaulting a girl
OL,14,Funder 13 by touching and causing or
OL,15,Finciting a girl under 13 to engage in
OL,16,Fsexual activity.
OL,18,FLincolnshire Police said the offences
OL,19,Ftook place between the 1980s and 2023
OL,20,Fand he was sentenced at Lincoln Crown
OL,21,FCourt earlier.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
