OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for multiple child
OL,4,Asexual offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Con Victoria Oaks, who led the
OL,7,Finvestigation, said Lynas, who had
OL,8,Fpreviously denied all the offences,
OL,9,F"caused real harm and will deservedly
OL,10,Fspend a long time behind bars".
